WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:06.423
At this month's end I
will select a few of you

00:00:06.423 --> 00:00:08.383
to work on my spring collection.

00:00:09.759 --> 00:00:11.261
Believe in your own vision.

00:00:11.261 --> 00:00:14.180
Push through self-doubt.

00:00:14.180 --> 00:00:16.933
I will not hesitate
to let you go.

00:00:16.933 --> 00:00:18.685
I just want it to be perfect.

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:23.481
I know you've been
stressed lately,

00:00:23.481 --> 00:00:25.817
but I'm worried about you, Anne.

00:00:27.110 --> 00:00:28.194
I'm dealing with it.

00:00:29.696 --> 00:00:30.780
You can tell me anything.

00:00:30.780 --> 00:00:31.614
Don't!

00:00:31.614 --> 00:00:33.033
Did something happen?

00:00:33.324 --> 00:00:34.951
This is going to sound
crazy,

00:00:37.579 --> 00:00:40.582
but have you ever seen anything
like this before?

00:00:42.792 --> 00:00:43.585
No.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:48.381
We have a new
guest with us today.

00:00:48.381 --> 00:00:50.800
You're here because we
all have the same problem.

00:00:51.259 --> 00:00:52.886
Some form of illness.

00:00:52.886 --> 00:00:54.220
Like a parasite.

00:00:56.681 --> 00:00:57.515
Are you OK?

00:00:57.515 --> 00:00:58.808
Don't touch me.

00:00:59.726 --> 00:01:01.061
Welcome to the club.

00:01:01.352 --> 00:01:04.481
Honestly it was the best thing
that ever happened to me.

00:01:06.441 --> 00:01:09.152
It's vile but everything
it tells you...

00:01:11.821 --> 00:01:13.073
...it’s true.

00:01:13.281 --> 00:01:14.407
I'll protect you.

00:01:15.408 --> 00:01:16.618
It can't be real.

00:01:18.578 --> 00:01:19.954
She's hiding
something down there.

00:01:27.420 --> 00:01:30.340
You can't get rid of me.

00:01:30.340 --> 00:01:32.759
Mm, so delicious.

